        "reason-6": {
          "type": "reason",
          "settings": {
            "number": "6",
            "title": "Moka was engineered in Switzerland to fix exactly this",
            "body": "<p>Moka is a <strong>Swiss-engineered bottle</strong> built around the one question the big brands avoided: what if nothing that touches your baby's milk had to be a compromise? It was created by a team of engineers and designers focused on infant safety from the ground up, not a legacy brand retrofitting an old plastic design. <strong>Every material was chosen to take heat, sterilizing and daily use without shedding into the feed.</strong> The safer swap, without the guesswork.</p>"
          }
        },
