        "reason-8": {
          "type": "reason",
          "settings": {
            "number": "8",
            "title": "Built so your baby actually takes to it, not just so it's safe",
            "body": "<p>Safe is worthless if your baby refuses it, so Moka's team didn't stop at materials. They engineered a <strong>bottom-vent anti-colic system that keeps air out of the feed</strong> while keeping milk away from the hot hard parts, and shaped the silicone nipple for a deeper, more natural latch. With flow rates matched to your baby's stage and backed by research and development, <strong>most babies adjust within a few days to a week</strong> instead of the bottle-after-bottle battle parents know too well.</p>"
          }
        },
