        "reason-9": {
          "type": "reason",
          "settings": {
            "number": "9",
            "title": "The honest part: it isn't the cheap option",
            "body": "<p>We won't pretend otherwise. Moka is a premium product and it's priced like one. Best-in-class glass, silicone and PPSU cost more than polypropylene, and our team reinvests heavily in testing and research and development to keep the mission intact. But here's the good part: the materials were built and tested in Switzerland to <strong>last roughly five times as long as conventional bottles</strong> without shedding microplastics. As parents ourselves, we know <strong>there's no price on knowing exactly what's in your baby's milk</strong>. Whether that's worth it is yours to decide.</p>"
          }
        },
